sdvm-s: x / y and x % y, signed, for x from -999 to 999 and y from -999 to 999 but not 0.
Cells 52-98. To call it, put y in cell 89, load x into the accumulator and JMP 52.
It returns the quotient x / y in the accumulator and the remainder x % y in cell 88.
It overwrites its own cells and cell 99, including y in cell 89 (negated when x < 0).
Size 47 cells. It runs at most 8,021 instructions, 49.8 on average, counted from cell 52 to the return jump in cell 98.
Exact over the domain.

